            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Equal-mass vacuum family</strong></span></span><section class=\"feynkit-integral-family\" style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><strong>Integral family</strong><div><strong>Loop momenta:</strong> <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">k1</div>, <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">k2</div></div><div><strong>External momenta:</strong> <em>none</em></div><div><strong>Dimension:</strong> <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">d</div></div><div>Rank: 3 / 3 &middot; complete &middot; independent</div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:.4rem\"><caption style=\"text-align:left\">Ordered inverse propagators (3)</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>1</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-M<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k1<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,k1<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>2</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-M<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k2<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,k2<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>3</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-M<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k1<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,k1<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>2\u00b7dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k1<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,k2<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k2<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,k2<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>d<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></section><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Six unit-Jacobian loop-momentum maps verify all denominator permutations.</span></span></div>"
