            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Computed Laporta reductions</strong></span></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The finite search used 230 equations from 58 seeds.</span></span><marimo-accordion data-labels='[&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eRaw reductions before momentum mappings&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;]' data-multiple='false'><div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>2,1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>1/2\u00b7d/M-1/M<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>1/3\u00b7d/M-1/M<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>1/6\u00b7d/M\u00b2-1/3/M\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>1/6\u00b7d/M\u00b2-1/3/M\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,0,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-1/3\u00b7d/M\u00b2+2/3/M\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,3<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>7/18\u00b7d/M\u00b3-1/18\u00b7d\u00b2/M\u00b3-5/9/M\u00b3<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-11/18\u00b7d/M\u00b2+1/18\u00b7d\u00b2/M\u00b2+4/3/M\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-13/36\u00b7d/M\u00b3+5/72\u00b7d\u00b2/M\u00b3+4/9/M\u00b3<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-13/36\u00b7d/M\u00b3+5/72\u00b7d\u00b2/M\u00b3+4/9/M\u00b3<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,0,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div></div></div></marimo-accordion><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Unresolved integral basis at this search depth</strong></span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,0,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The verified mappings identify the three disconnected routings as <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(T^2=I_{110}||)</marimo-tex>; write <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(V=I_{111}||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>2,1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/2\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>d\u00b7T2-2\u00b7T2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/M</div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">V</div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/3\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>d\u00b7V-3\u00b7V<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/M</div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,1,3<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/36\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-22\u00b7d\u00b7M\u00b7V-12\u00b7d\u00b7T2+48\u00b7M\u00b7V+12\u00b7T2+2\u00b7d\u00b2\u00b7M\u00b7V+3\u00b7d\u00b2\u00b7T2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/M\u00b3</div></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Reduced self-energy integral combination</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-1/216\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>4\u00b7d\u00b7M\u00b7p2\u00b7V+54\u00b7d\u00b7M\u00b7T2+48\u00b7d\u00b7p2\u00b7T2-36\u00b7d\u00b7M\u00b2\u00b7V-48\u00b7M\u00b7p2\u00b7V-48\u00b7p2\u00b7T2+4\u00b7d\u00b2\u00b7M\u00b7p2\u00b7V\n    -27\u00b7d\u00b2\u00b7M\u00b7T2-12\u00b7d\u00b2\u00b7p2\u00b7T2\n<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>d\u00b7M\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div></div>"
