class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Renormalization constants <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_\\phi||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_m||)</marimo-tex></strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>1/6144\u00b7g\u00b2/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 0, 205)\">\ud835\udf0b</span>\u2074\u00b7eps<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/32\u00b7g/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 0, 205)\">\ud835\udf0b</span>\u00b2\u00b7eps<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>5/6144\u00b7g\u00b2/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 0, 205)\">\ud835\udf0b</span>\u2074\u00b7eps<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/512\u00b7g\u00b2/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 0, 205)\">\ud835\udf0b</span>\u2074\u00b7eps\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan&#92;u003eThe computed IBP reductions and supplied analytic integral values reproduce the reference UV poles and renormalization constants.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;success&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>"
